    {
      "text": "Photograph of a man in a World Health Organization vest lifting a box labelled \"Fragile\", \"Handle with care\" and \"Trauma\" kit beside an aircraft, with stacked boxes of WHO trauma kits and a UN aircraft on the runway behind.",
